### 1. login (ustawia cookies)
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "rafalb92@ironoak.pl", "password": "supersecret123" }

### 2. kto jestem (sprawdź role: ADMIN)
GET {{host}}/auth/me

### Get all products
GET {{host}}/products

### GEt cart
GET {{host}}/cart

### Remove all items from cart
DELETE {{host}}/cart

### 1. złóż zamówienie (przez koszyk lub bezpośrednio)
POST {{host}}/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productVariantId": "{{variantId}}", "quantity": 4 }

###
POST {{host}}/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "deliveryAddress": { "street": "Main Street", "buildingNumber": "123", "city": "New York", "postalCode": "10001", "country": "US" } }

### --- weź orderId ---
@orderId = 4e7f19d0-cc3f-47c1-8507-31d16e295df7

### 2. zainicjuj płatność → dostajesz checkoutUrl
POST {{host}}/orders/{{orderId}}/pay

### --- weź sessionId z URL-a ---
@sessionId = cs_test_a1UwjkgzTyRlirY4DUXZwb6pWKZQRciTJhAWFxgkHu8x1nvzeJESWTp1Ld

### 3. druga próba — powinna zwrócić TEN SAM url (idempotencja)
POST {{host}}/orders/{{orderId}}/pay

### 4. symuluj udaną płatność
POST {{host}}/payments/simulate/{{sessionId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "outcome": "success" }

### 5. odczekaj ~5s (worker) i sprawdź status
GET {{host}}/orders/{{orderId}}